<title>ITALY: Canal Plus 2.0 bln FRF issue closes earl.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus 2.0 bln FRF issue closes earl.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 2.0 billion French franc equity-linked issue by Canal Plus announced on Tuesday has closed early, a joint lead source said.</p>
<p>The issue, expiring February 28, 2002 and exchangeable into shares of Italian broadcaster Mediaset, was announced earlier on Tuesday by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers and UBS.</p>
<p>&quot;The close was expected no later than Thursday February 13 but the objective was late afternoon today. There was interest above all from foreign investors,&quot; the source said.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
